cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ann-mpc-cold-storage: Code and figures for the ANN-MPC cold storage paper"
abstract: >-
  Code and figures for the paper "ANN-Based Model Predictive Control with
  Predictive Maintenance for Energy-Efficient Cold Storage Systems". Includes
  MATLAB scripts that train a 4-4-1 feedforward ANN with Bayesian
  regularisation, run four MPC simulation scenarios (baseline thermostat,
  healthy MPC, degraded MPC, maintenance-aware MPC) and generate the 17
  figures used in the paper, plus a Python generator that produces the
  168-hour synthetic operating dataset used throughout the study.
